PETSELFTEST1
# V2 home action rail + partial refresh, no person needed.
# Rail: 0 chat, 1 story (default), 2 game, 3 feed, 4 sleep.
# expect home_select 0,1,2,3,4,3,2,1,0,1,2,3,2,1
# expect commits 4
# expect selftest_done 1
# expect max_partial_ms 2500
# expect max_full_ms 5000
# expect partial_refreshes 14
# expect full_refreshes 5
# Let XiaoZhi finish Wi-Fi/activation so Pet mode can start.
wait 25000
pet
wait 7000
# 9 highlight moves: 8 partials, then the planner forces a full refresh.
tap up 2500
tap down 2500
tap down 2500
tap down 2500
tap down 2500
# Clamped at Sleep: no move, no refresh.
tap down 2500
tap up 2500
tap up 2500
tap up 2500
tap up 2500
# Feed (index 3): durable Feed, happy face via partial refresh.
tap down 2500
tap down 2500
tap down 2500
tap press 6000
# Story (index 1): reader page 1, next page, then back home.
tap up 2500
tap up 2500
tap press 7000
tap down 7000
hold press 1500 7000
pet
wait 5000
end
